## 10. Session handoff
At session end, if anything meaningful changed: copy `agent-sessions/_TEMPLATE.md` to `agent-sessions/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md`, fill it, and prepend a line to `agent-sessions/INDEX.md`. Skip for pure Q&A.
